      "content": "she loved strawberry ice cream. every single time, strawberry. never wanted to try any other flavor no matter how many times i tried to get her to. god i would do anything to sit in that ice cream shop with her one more time and watch her eat it\n\ni can't do this. i just can't. i don't want a life that she's not in. she was 7. she was supposed to have so much life left and now i'm just... here. existing. and i don't understand why i'm supposed to keep doing that",
